{% comment %}
  Founder's Note Section
{% endcomment %}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playwrite+IN:wght@100..400&family=Playwrite+US+Trad:wght@100..400&display=swap"
  rel="stylesheet"
>

<section class="founders-note-section">
  <div class="founders-note-section__container">
    <div class="founders-note-section__header">
      <h2 class="founders-note-section__title">A Note from the <em>Founder...</em></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="founders-note-section__content">
      <p class="founders-note-section__text">
        When we launched <span class="founders-note-section__highlight">Sacred Secret</span>, it quickly became more
        than a serum it became a part of people's routines, and for many, it worked like magic. But not everyone had the
        same experience. Some found the texture heavy, some felt it sticky, and the pump design itself caused
        frustration. As a founder, it was the hardest decision to stop, pause everything, and go back to the lab, even
        with marketing already running.
      </p>

      <p class="founders-note-section__text">
        For nine months, we dedicated ourselves to reformulation. We sourced the purest ingredients from Korea, Africa,
        and India, and tested more than forty iterations until we found the one that felt truly complete. The result is
        <span class="founders-note-section__highlight">Sacred Secret 2.0</span> - a serum that is super light,
        ultra-luxurious, and weightless on the skin. It absorbs effortlessly, leaving behind only comfort, radiance, and
        results.
      </p>

      <p class="founders-note-section__text">
        <span class="founders-note-section__highlight">Sacred Secret 2.0</span> is not just a reformulation; it is our
        promise that when something can be made better, we will never settle.
      </p>

      <div class="founders-note-section__signature">
        <div class="founders-note-section__signature-container">
          <img src="{{ 'sign.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Suysh Signature" class="founders-note-section__signature-image">
          <div class="founders-note-section__signature-text">- Suysh, Founder</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founders-note-section {
    background: #fef9f2;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .founders-note-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: url('{{ 'paper-texture.jpg' | asset_url }}');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    opacity: 0.5;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .founders-note-section__container {
    max-width: 65%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .founders-note-section__header {
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .founders-note-section__title {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', sans-serif;
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 200;
    color: #63001f;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .founders-note-section__content {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .founders-note-section__text {
    font-family: 'Playwrite IN', cursive;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 2;
    word-spacing: 0.2em;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .founders-note-section__text:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0rem;
  }

  .founders-note-section__highlight {
  }

  .founders-note-section__signature {
    text-align: right;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .founders-note-section__signature-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .founders-note-section__signature-image {
    max-width: 60px;
    height: auto;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .founders-note-section__signature-text {
    width: 120px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #63001f;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Mobile responsive adjustments */
  @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
    .founders-note-section {
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .founders-note-section__container {
      max-width: 100%;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .founders-note-section__header {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .founders-note-section__title {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .founders-note-section__text {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      word-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }

    .founders-note-section__signature {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .founders-note-section__signature-container {
      gap: 0.3rem;
    }

    .founders-note-section__signature-image {
      max-width: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .founders-note-section__signature-text {
      width: 100px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
  }
</style>
